      "text": " workflow{\n    //Defines the workflow and how data moves between\n\n    ch = Channel.fromPath (params.input)\n    \n    SO_SOMETHING(ch)\n\n    DO_ANOTHER_THING(DO_SOMETHING.out)        \n }",
